# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every OS.
#
# The packaged runtime (src/scrumaidev/runtime/core/) is hashed byte-for-byte
# into `core_sha256` / `runtime_sha256`. Without this file, a Windows checkout
# with `core.autocrlf=true` turns text files into CRLF, so a wheel built from
# that checkout would carry a different core identity than the official
# release, and `installer/install.sh` would not run under sh. Matches
# `.editorconfig` (end_of_line = lf).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts: never convert.
*.zip binary
*.whl binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
